# 统一换行符：仓库内一律存 LF，检出到 Windows 时按需要转换。
# 不加这个的话，git 会在每次 add 时刷一屏 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 警告，
# 而且协作者之间会因为行尾差异产生无意义的 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不要做任何换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary

# Windows 批处理必须保留 CRLF，否则可能无法执行
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 让 git diff / git log 正确识别语言，便于 review
*.md text diff=markdown
*.sql text
*.js text
*.jsx text
*.mjs text
*.cjs text
*.css text
*.html text
*.json text
